01:07:16.750 --> 01:07:20.707
and suggests there that he
thinks that they need some help

01:07:20.707 --> 01:07:22.700
in understanding "Capital".

01:07:22.700 --> 01:07:26.760
And so that he's going
to do some translating

01:07:26.760 --> 01:07:30.870
that's a mix really of
translation and self commentary.

01:07:30.870 --> 01:07:34.743
So in any case, what are
your thoughts on this?

01:07:36.240 --> 01:07:37.630
- Now, I mean, it's a good question.

01:07:37.630 --> 01:07:42.630
So part of this comes down to
like what's your sense of Marx

01:07:42.890 --> 01:07:45.740
as a person and how do
you read his letters?

01:07:45.740 --> 01:07:50.740
For example, some of these letters,

01:07:52.470 --> 01:07:57.230
I certainly Marx was thrilled
to have a Russian translation

01:07:57.230 --> 01:08:02.230
coming out, and he was
very happy with that.

01:08:03.980 --> 01:08:08.197
I think that some of his,
